      "value": "ワールドのサムネイルの片隅に、どの地域・国から人気があるかのアイコンを付けてほしいという要望です。\nあらかじめどこに人気があるのかわかれば、意図的に異文化交流をしにいったり、自分が住んでいる地域や、国のユーザーを探すのが簡単になります。\nあまりにもごちゃまぜが過ぎるのは、将棋が好きなユーザーと囲碁が好きなユーザーと騒ぐのが好きなユーザーを無理に混ぜるようなものです。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-02T06:47:11.988Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/active-by-language-world-rows\nI'm posting this, although it overlaps to some extent with this Feedback.\n\nIt would be nice to be able to show which regions (either by server or by country conversion) or countries are the most popular in the world icon in icon form.\nI would only assume that popularity as a single community would be popular among users of English, which is the main language of the VRC, but it would be great information for users who want to interact in multiple languages if they could see the preferences of a particular region.\n(They can prepare themselves in advance that they might plunge into an exotic language community.)\n(There is far too much information to be lost if it is forced to be grouped together as one communal community. It's like mixing up the preferences of old people with those of kids.)",
